					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6134033#post-3846931</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6134033/good-fences-make-good-neighbors#post-3846931</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 23 Jun 2018 03:01:52 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Jacob Conwell</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1372582</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I really like Nobody here. There is a certain slickness to the characterization that really stands out, and his smug personality is both entertaining and makes me want to punch him. On top of that, the Foundation wasn't made to look incompetent as he went about his one-man raid.</p> <p>All around a solid tale. +1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
