					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Okay, that was neat. I haven't seen anything Nobody-related in quite a long time <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">or have I?</span>, and I like your take on him. I also especially like the solid behind-the-scenes protocol at use with the interrogation personnel. Not something you see often in articles or tales, and it all rings true. Of course, now I want to know where this is going. :)</p> 
				 	]]>
